        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>36 Inch Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe perfect finishing touch to any kitchen, this 24 Inch C.C. Ladder Appliance Pull can be used to upgrade standard appliance handles to take your kitchen from out-of-the-box standard to modern very easily. It comes packaged with one handle and the mounting hardware for installation on a appliance panel. The 36 Inch Refrigerator Pull is available in satin nickel, oil rubbed bronze, and polished chrome finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-47-specifications.gif?v=1704354599\" width=\"503\" height=\"128\" border=\"0\" alt=\"36 Inch Ladder Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/36-inch-ladder-door-pull-with-24-inch-center-to-centers-sgs-h3600\"><b>36\" Ladder Door Pull</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Modern 36\" Appliance Handle with 24\" Center to Centers:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Length: 24\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\" Round Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Point Diameter: 27/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-15/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually (1 door pull handle).</i>\r\n</p>",
